{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：12:00 2026-10-06 HKT</p>\n\n<p>最新一期《東周刊》獨家直擊，現年49歲、即將「入五」的前歌手張新悅現身銅鑼灣名店「血拼」掃貨。當日張新悅在一間高級首飾店內駐足，對一條精緻頸鏈情有獨鍾，在店員熱情推介下隨即試戴，對著鏡子細心打量且面露滿意笑容，心情明顯大幅放晴，似乎已將早前的種種煩惱拋諸腦後。張新悅早於1997年出道，曾拍劇、出歌及參演電影，自2007年與前立法局議員楊孝華幼子、現任山頂區區議員楊哲安結婚後便淡出幕前，專心相夫教女，接連誕下4名千金。雖然她曾被外界猜測是為「追仔」或豪門生活而不停生育，但她多次澄清自己熱愛大家庭，毫無追生男丁的包袱，一家六口原本其樂融融，豈料早前卻因大女的健康風波而鬧得滿城風雨，如今藉購物減壓重拾歡顏。</p>\n<h2>張新悅大女腦膜炎險死惹議</h2>\n<p>這場引發關注的爭議，源於張新悅月前作客HOY TV電視節目《九運會客室》時，首度公開長女於2022年險死的驚險經過。她透露長女當年不幸患上可於一日內致命的嚴重「細菌性腦膜炎」，入院後情況十萬火急，需先後進行兩次大型手術，期間更一度出現「生魂離體」的命懸一線狀態。張新悅在節目中激動表示，在生死攸關之際幸獲「師傅」與菩薩慈悲出手，以蓮花護佑長女生魂免受冤親債主侵害，才奇蹟般起死回生；其後長女雖出現半身無知覺、智力受損等嚴重後遺症，亦在師傅教導下逐步好轉。然而，這番言論曝光後隨即惹來大批網民抨擊，指責她思想過度迷信、抹殺公立醫院全體專業醫護團隊的搶救功勞，更有聲音質疑該名「師傅」借機斂財。</p>\n<img alt=\"最新一期《東周刊》獨家直擊，張新悅現身銅鑼灣名店「血拼」掃貨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9f882033f49c240881dc4415d37be5c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_4_46_46_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅在一間高級首飾店內駐足，對一條精緻頸鏈情有獨鍾。（《東周刊》圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a97c37d87b0f14e1533f84ea09ce04b0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_4_50_59_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅似乎已將早前的種種煩惱拋諸腦後。（《東周刊》圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a4974c2f90a209468033ce34e69b159/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_4_51_00_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅在店員熱情推介下隨即試戴。（《東周刊》圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ae6035f2e4ccb1dc4166c5dc98a1d27/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_4_51_00_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅為老公誕下四個女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9beed8b38f29076bcf6d2bd6dca58d1a/2023-01/36617897_328933284310711_5544315905938292736_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家六口生活幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/032a6da728a16eb1f1f19843eea539d6/2023-01/1o4NMgfSM2xtvY_hR41GW0hBFq1vMdvzw0SRHMNEkRw.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅談及女兒病況。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0aa9ecbe546ca5d10cece812543f5114/2026-07/nicolacheungyoung_Dapm_JKkmXn_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新月大女入院一刻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e97e3851f8c7e53eeac75b43cee2c9f6/2026-07/nicolacheungyoung_Dapm_JKkmXn_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新月説：「當時她的生魂已經離開了身體，她原本已經會死了！」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e17ac3e5201e1670decfb1c0bdc0689f/2026-07/nicolacheungyoung_Dapm_JKkmXn_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新月指病人就算沒有死也大有機一世有後遺症。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb0f031f2d3945179cb61b682e8e8b96/2026-07/nicolacheungyoung_Dapm_JKkmXn_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新月大女很快康復。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00a49d50a10026b2213f804971124ea3/2026-07/nicolacheungyoung_Dapm_JKkmXn_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新月感恩冤親寬宏大量放過她的女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8e315628cd0908e0bbc3bec4049a05d/2026-07/nicolacheungyoung_Dapm_JKkmXn_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新月這經歷栩栩如生，刻骨銘心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c79d697978bf25ce9e1d7c5876dd9d7/2026-07/nicolacheungyoung_Dapm_JKkmXn_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"成日喺IG晒靚相！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f15cbc5aed359961a97def8e04f60cbf/2023-01/318539149_548810127062048_921166902119435890_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅已經是四女之母。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bec90746092ecb42fad30e6c1e6105c1/2023-01/EfQ1uaWyZ3qj_vfopY9U0JNd5mIOBbToYfd2gWH3doE.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"保養得好好！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a68e645da0e80d185055076e8234d40/2023-01/GsHx_qd4czqRTcmzn5FXwvwQFtoE47H3PLvYkDy72JA.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅經常與囡囡在家中的大廚房玩下廚樂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c38f9d3c6f47ec4650075d33326fdff/2023-01/iehHdHqKYSBpUWjlrk7FCT99Cm1bxxhuX899-l_Pffo.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳相當巨大！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0153ffb3673167deec814516b88a0b8a/2023-01/j-oSwJ1zlygUbb7ffFwzRqZZb6q81Xh-LBAGDiwQBg4.jpg\"/>\n<h2>張新悅拍片哽咽力撐恩師</h2>\n<p>面對排山倒海的輿論抨擊，張新悅特意親自拍攝短片逐一反駁澄清。她首先強調自己在事發後早已於社交平台公開發文，由衷感謝全體醫護人員及醫院保安團隊的專業付出，並指出頂尖科學家同樣可以擁有宗教信仰，兩者並無衝突；同時，她力證「師傅」為人極度低調，日常絕不做生意亦不收取分文酬勞，救治過程中更從未開壇、燒符或接觸長女，僅以佛法智慧化解業障。說到激動處，張新悅更忍不住落淚哽咽，引用俗諺「未經他人苦，莫論他人非」，懇求公眾保持客觀與仁厚，切勿隨意中傷救女恩人。隨著短片發布，這場輿論風波終告平息，經歷人生試煉的張新悅亦走出陰霾，重回幸福人母的生活軌道。</p>\n<p>想睇最新一期《東周刊》詳細報導，即刻點擊：https://bit.ly/4APuUk6</p>\n<img alt=\"大女走出鬼門關。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea93c9c5ad61fd9880874a9c79d63ac4/2023-01/unknown_326133151_901158474649110_724274629220593945_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅早前因女兒患病，膽戰心驚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d17b16ec2db25735553c2541fd4e14bb/2023-01/x1q2wMHIojJPVygWyjMAIkoCVNJ2jLbvkNdTAZDXUwE.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"囡囡已康復。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2e4b13a9ccb7aa60c4faef84a3de660/2023-01/VideoScreenshot--NicolaCheungakanicolacheungyoungInstagram-0%E2%80%9904%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"想不到合照背後，竟然發生了一件驚險的事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bdca03a58d5d2c099cc93a7a0727657a/2023-01/unknown_326987583_206423255242006_8098688622423554663_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅早前因大女病倒，膽顫心驚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2e4b13a9ccb7aa60c4faef84a3de660/2023-01/VideoScreenshot--NicolaCheungakanicolacheungyoungInstagram-0%E2%80%9904%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅大女已經康復。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a630c9f973f3d3344879cc7dae3619d/2023-03/Nicola%20%20%283%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅為救大女，曾與老公多度去求助師父菩薩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f0a0e6e993adf911f1ab241aa2fab59/2023-03/Nicola%20%20%284%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅逾2,000字長文（一）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d08bd123e605a4bf8127829c35379600/2023-03/CAP1.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅逾2,000字長文（二）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d15b76869f6bc183625159a1a27e633/2023-03/CAP2.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅逾2,000字長文（三）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0de1f109c08c5f7e4d437e9a076df4ab/2023-03/CAP3.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅逾2,000字長文（四）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5dca4399f382d69a12ef69bd57ce48aa/2023-03/CAP4.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在不少公開場合都見到她的身影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/199465e7927a61229b8cfafadcf18fa2/2023-03/nicolacheungyoung_335633795_774646507394443_8673053322221482159_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"心情放鬆不少的她笑容特別燦爛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/071dd814b888233fdacf4b9616df585f/2023-03/nicolacheungyoung_336280952_740361784203319_5392843391511470001_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"更與老公一齊公開出席活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6b0adbd8137f09dab97aa94b046112c1/2023-03/nicolacheungyoung_335932816_1002498487830768_5041967850616636695_n%20%281%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大女康復後，張新悅可放心再出席活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6dddf409ebe37c3462f2d915389a1650/2023-04/unknown_329795789_194865593321824_4264698341506726869_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅講述大女死裡逃生的經歷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8c1cbdc89f51adb27c7ecbcf9290ece7/2023-04/unknown_338585982_764382428455679_5887665399711787126_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"對於女兒奇蹟般庙復，張新悅大感欣慰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b5505f0187ec6c2d3869da0c06e079c/2023-04/unknown_340663355_2426571974171575_1153802217044359637_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"帶女兒到長隆野生動物園。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59ceda6879c49a3322ad9dc66971ca3f/2023-04/unknown_340682667_3361146224139213_4099157654733868392_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"再次發長文講述女兒康復後的神奇經歷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d57937288698fdf8542117651486617/2023-04/C1_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"再次發長文講述女兒康復後的神奇經歷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b29640b55af86ebecaa52a31683f63a/2023-04/C2_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"經常貼合照放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9688a4498f8229ccbd518009902ecfd7/2023-01/R7a2qTkXLnS1eo3gSrKf_piVprx6DES-HBYY1BwWGNQ.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"家居佈置簡潔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c8c92746e56f6adda8584f3ab6a8d42/2023-01/TAdTS-4xGgQQwQUbrJXCCYs0HRXJCXvNXpb3Ul6W91I.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"淡出娛樂圈生活好寫意！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/218d10e43f297040145deef923a6af5e/2023-01/yIV9emHFIGa14Wf_z-n13m2GP-WmpG8c43GTSeNxk0k.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"去年對張新悅而言感慨良多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2bc4dd0583743d62a6d756f6576958fa/2023-01/unknown_325694124_1564134564052302_8038649049623229509_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張新悅與丈夫楊哲安育有四名女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2450ca531ca51b367ee39a01e718e4d2/2023-04/C3_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大女兒重返英國讀書。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d00d3a0eafe3b84404fe20dc64dc92b7/2023-04/unknown_340809005_558147002970782_4166117557131569078_n.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T04:20:21.800586+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":966,"images":44,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}